section start
title start
Purpose
title end

paragraph start
Add one to a number. It does not read input, print anything or check that the input is a number.
answer start
for: q5e4923
asked: What problem does this module solve, and what does it leave out?
It gives the other code one named step for adding one, and nothing more.
answer end
paragraph end

