paragraph start
The code goes in a code block, with its language written under the start line.
paragraph end

code start
language: racket
(define (add-one n)
  (+ n 1))
code end

comment start
A code body is opaque, so a question about code cannot be answered inside it. A person answers it here, beside the code.
comment end
